    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's no seed left. there's nothing to grow from. it's like i poured everything i had into a hole in the ground and now the hole is just empty. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person, i just see a failed investment. what's the point in even trying to start over when the damage is already done?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
